{"id":"n87135-1-16","stage":4,"title":"현기증 · 眩晕症","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87135-1-16-1","ko":"왜 그래? 머리 아파?","zh":"怎么了？头疼吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래?","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"머리","meaning":"头","explanation":"머리：头","readings":[{"term":"머리","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66234","senseId":"1","lemma":"머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아파?","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"74eee3ddf202a62b","term":"머리","zh":"头","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3","entryId":"66234","definition":"在人或动物身体中，包括脸和头发的脖子以上的部分。","pronunciation":["머리"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]}],"audio":"/audio/382859f03e236f3689cd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87135-1-16-2","ko":"갑자기 현기증이 나서 그래. 조금 쉬었다가 가자.","zh":"突然觉得头晕，我们先休息一会儿再走吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"현기증이","meaning":"眩晕症，晕眩症，眩晕，晕眩","explanation":"현기증：眩晕症，晕眩症，眩晕，晕眩；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"현기증","audio":"/audio/8bd56841ed640bff7a6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87135","senseId":"1","lemma":"현기증","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나서","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조금","meaning":"片刻，一会儿","explanation":"조금：片刻，一会儿","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"2","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쉬었다가","meaning":"休息，歇","explanation":"쉬다：休息，歇；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71280","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가자.","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"8bd56841ed640bff","term":"현기증","zh":"眩晕症，晕眩症，眩晕，晕眩","audio":"/audio/8bd56841ed640bff7a6f.mp3","entryId":"87135","definition":"头晕目眩而导致精神恍惚的症状。","pronunciation":["현ː기쯩"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现某种现象或事件。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"片刻，一会儿","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"短暂时间。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"62b3b824836a1f2c","term":"쉬다","zh":"休息，歇","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3","entryId":"71280","definition":"为去除疲劳而使身体舒适。","pronunciation":["쉬ː다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c94bba211574faefc1a1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.4,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=87135","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":124,"sequenceScore":2.2267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["怎么了？头疼吗？","突然觉得头晕，我们先休息一会儿再走吧。","听说要选接任的部长？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["怎么了？头疼吗？","突然觉得头晕，我们先休息一会儿再走吧。","听说要选接任的部长？"],"answer":1}]}
